## Scientific And Domain Assessments

### Material-versus-atom judgment is the recorded method

grounding: supported. Targets: Sulfur.

The exact new method delta is supported and the complete predecessor content is preserved.

The preserved baseline #368 event and CURATOR_JUDGMENT establish bulk elemental sulfur CHEBI:33403 rather than sulfur atom/polysulfur. Cached official label and weighed DSMZ powders support this method rationale without selecting an allotrope or lot. MANUAL_CURATION is truthful method provenance; every rejected label, source alias, role/environment claim and history prefix is unchanged. A authored earlier G03 union, so the independent conclusion is confined to C's new method delta and preservation. W09 prior eff9 scope is separately attributed, and W09 must review the whole current successor.

### Primary borax formula accounting is the recorded method

grounding: supported. Targets: Na2b4o7_X_10_H2o.

The exact new method delta is supported and the complete predecessor content is preserved.

The actual source history documents structural adjudication: conventional Na2B4O7·10H2O and hydroxylated Na2[B4O5(OH)4]·8H2O are explicitly associated by the captured IUCr crystal paper; official ChEBI38888 structure/mass and Sigma supplied form corroborate that bounded choice. This is not a primary-label match or a general hydrate-equivalence rule. The method-only successor retains CHEBI38888, CAS/structure, all source labels, DSMZ770 stock/MD196-routing hold and unreviewed role. Exact three existing UW dependencies remain required.

### Representation adjudication is preserved alongside the genuine lookup

grounding: supported. Targets: Diarsenic_Trioxide.

The exact new method delta is supported and the complete predecessor content is preserved.

The actual OLS q=As2O3&amp;exact=true query has seven results, including one chebi-ontology CHEBI30621 hit and imported copies; no missing-search claim is justified. The final source proposal positively resolved prior empirical As2O3 versus molecular As4O6 uncertainty using ChEBI's2:3 definition and PubChem empirical formula. MANUAL_CURATION describes that decisive documented adjudication, not LLM authorship alone. CCAP UCM supplies oxide separately from NaOH preparation. Same CHEBI30621 exact identity, As2O3 alias, original evidence, no molecular-weight/polymorph/lot claims and CultureMech283 quantity/stock hold remain.

### Every prior field, event and genuine origin is preserved

provenance: supported. Targets: Sulfur, Na2b4o7_X_10_H2o, Diarsenic_Trioxide.

Resetting the method and removing exactly the appended evidence/event reconstructs each complete predecessor object; native serialization is exact.

All six original published proposal objects and eight original case bindings verified against Git; Sulfur retains four origins. Create Diarsenic remains a real null-preimage create. This is not a new origin, changed source outcome or application decision. New MappingEvidence uses LLM_SUGGESTION; MANUAL_CURATION here is only mapping_quality.

### The unchanged producer emits the expected method provenance without identity drift

consistency: supported. Targets: Sulfur, Na2b4o7_X_10_H2o, Diarsenic_Trioxide.

Three actual-KG differential rows change only method, confidence and source. Own-identifier exact predicates, object IDs/labels, aliases, comments and suppression results remain exact.

Confidence0.9 is the native method-grade heuristic, not measured probability. Repeated evidence-source tokens are native output, not distinct votes. The authentic2957-record bounded overlay requires the three original UW corrections; it does not constitute the full corrected-batch generation, prior-stamp replay or positive export admission.

