## Limits And Additional Notes

- This is an independent assessment of three new method deltas with full payload-preservation checks, not fresh whole-owner or whole-campaign scientific approval. Root's separate W09 review of all four current corrective owners and three deferrals remains required.
- Reviewer /root/next23_context authored an earlier Sulfur G03 union. Its old composition is not independently re-approved here; W09's old eff9 whole-row/owner support is separately attributed and limited. C authored the later Sulfur composition and these successors; its pair is self_review/scientific_review=false.
- The three old W09 method findings are addressed in these private candidates at the assessed scope; original NEEDS_CURATION observations, unrelated findings and tracker state are not erased or declared closed.
- No roles, occurrence applicability, chemical quantities, stocks, lot/allotrope/polymorph, environmental claims, canonical rows or supported export are promoted. Unknowns and all original holds persist. Benzene-triol is outside this correction.
- Borax must retain the three exact original UW reference corrections; an isolated Borax installation leaves three pre-existing broken references. No new child identity or dependency approval is made.
- Native row checking used authentic committed A842 inventory, three candidate replacements plus three existing UW corrections, actual read-only KG gzip and cached official labels. It is a per-owner diagnostic, not complete corrected-source generation or actual B/C row acceptance. No provider fetch or new research was run.
- Private native pair is serialized, rendered, exclusively published and strictly parsed with actual M working-tree provenance using maintained APIs. It is not installed in the maintained review store and does not claim save_review publication there. No private Git root or fictional baseline was created.
- Original C missing-parent refusal, isolated-overlay assertion and initial native target-kind refusal remain preserved. W09 original anchor-bearing native pair is not presented as valid native acceptance; scoped scientific JSON evidence remains separately attributed.
- No partial old B owner tree was read as a complete after-state. No native prepare, source application, synchronization, canonical write, Git/GitHub mutation or process control occurred.

